#: ../../source/docs/ros-connecting.rst:5 a0f0fafbb6f74ce9881c72c30501969a
msgid "Connecting with ROS"
msgstr "连接 ROS"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-connecting.rst:7 3b88481a0d9d43e38f65c1f16170ab93
msgid ""
"Before attempting to connect with ROS, ensure that the physical serial cable"
" connection and ArduPilot side parameters have been set as described on the "
"appropriate companion computer page (:ref:`RPi3 <raspberry-pi-via-mavlink>`,"
" :ref:`NVidia TX1 <companion-computer-nvidia-tx1>`, :ref:`NVidia TX2 "
"<companion-computer-nvidia-tx2>` or :ref:`Intel Edison <intel-edison>`)."
msgstr ""
"连接 ROS 前，请确保物理串口连接和 ArduPilot 端参数已按相应伴飞计算机页面的说明设置（:ref:`RPi3 <raspberry-pi-"
"via-mavlink>`、:ref:`NVidia TX1 <companion-computer-nvidia-tx1>`、:ref:`NVidia"
" TX2 <companion-computer-nvidia-tx2>` 或 :ref:`Intel Edison <intel-edison>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-connecting.rst:9 ff84f977addc4d7bb8577b62009a47c3
msgid ""
"The connection between ArduPilot running on the flight controller and "
"ROS/MAVROS can be established with the following commands on the companion "
"computer:"
msgstr "可在伴飞计算机上执行以下命令，建立飞控上运行的 ArduPilot 与 ROS/MAVROS 之间的连接："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-connecting.rst:11 17615c766b994b5c8a5b8516fd4d739d
msgid "open up a terminal and type, \"roscore\""
msgstr "打开一个终端并输入「roscore」"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-connecting.rst:12 ffb730f647134275b1b14aad0fc4a714
msgid ""
"open another terminal and start mavros as described `here on the ros/mavros "
"wiki <http://wiki.ros.org/mavros#Usage>`__.  For example, the following "
"instruction is appropriate for a TX2/APSync install with port 14855 opened "
"(see \"How flight controller data is routed to various programs\" at the "
"bottom of :ref:`this page <apsync-intro>`):"
msgstr ""
"打开另一个终端并按 `ros/mavros wiki 此处 <http://wiki.ros.org/mavros#Usage>`__ 所述启动 "
"mavros。例如，以下指令适用于已开放 14855 端口的 TX2/APSync 安装（参见 :ref:`此页面 <apsync-intro>` "
"底部的「飞控数据路由至各程序的方式」）："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-connecting.rst:18 3af19bce09e240c2a9bee93e81717072
msgid ""
"Test the flight controller is responding to `mavros commands "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/mavros#Utility_commands>`__ like `mavsys "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/mavros#mavsys>`__ (which can set the flight mode) and "
"`mavsafety <http://wiki.ros.org/mavros#mavsafety>`__ (which can arm/disarm "
"the vehicle):"
msgstr ""
"测试飞控是否响应 `mavros 命令 <http://wiki.ros.org/mavros#Utility_commands>`__，如 "
"`mavsys <http://wiki.ros.org/mavros#mavsys>`__ （可设置飞行模式）和 `mavsafety "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/mavros#mavsafety>`__ （可解锁/锁定飞行器）："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-connecting.rst:27 11b6a38f7f5845208dbeaf6b3454f52e
msgid ""
"We are keen to improve ArduPilot's support of ROS so if you find issues "
"(such as commands that do not seem to be supported), please report them in "
"the `ArduPilot issues list "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ with a title that "
"includes \"ROS\" and we will attempt to resolve them as quickly as possible."
msgstr ""
"我们致力于改进 ArduPilot 对 ROS 的支持，若发现问题（如似乎不支持的命令），请在 `ArduPilot 问题列表 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ 中提交，标题包含「ROS」，我们将尽快解决。"
